== Blessed sister

#poem[][

Blessed sister I do not \
understand your blessing \
Hermana bendito no entiendo \
su bendición

estoy humiliado\
by this pilgrimage

Puedo sentir los oyos de Mary\
on this tiny church

Yo dije gracias you place your \
hands on my head\
Me agache because\
I am demesiado alto\
for this grace

][01]